From 66e8ef0b2e8ec55f8221c2e0150355aed7aca72b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:32:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD review completion confirmation so accepted patch
 chats close cleanly

No-findings review results prompt in the reviewed patch-agent chat instead of requiring a separate review-chat closure. The controller treats yes/y as a local completion answer, reopens the patch agent for any other follow-up, and the terminal adapter mirrors that state so closed chats disappear from the active list.
